  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Warp; <strong>CL</strong> 6th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> —; <strong>Price</strong> 6,000 (for a pair) gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 15 lbs. (each).<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nMade in pairs, these caskets are spatially linked. So long as a set of caskets are on the same plane, the contents of the caskets can be swapped by speaking a command word. Only inanimate objects can be transferred this way. Each casket can be used once per day.</p>\n<p>A casket can hold 1 cubic ft. of material, and is typically fitted with a lock.<br>\n<strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Wondrous Item, Warp sphere, Teleport Beacon, Teleport Object; <strong>Cost</strong> 3,000 gp</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/marvelous-items-2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
